<rml><head><title>Unsaved HUD layout</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/app-shell.rml"/><link type="text/rcss" href="editor.rcss"/></head><body template="prime-shell"><div id="native_hud_unsaved"><h1>KEEP YOUR HUD CHANGES?</h1><p>Use this layout in your Settings draft, discard your HUD edits, or keep editing. Apply Settings to activate a layout.</p><button id="native_hud_apply" class="play_action" data-action="hud:use">USE IN SETTINGS</button><button id="native_hud_discard" class="play_action" data-action="hud:cancel">DISCARD HUD EDITS</button><button id="native_hud_keep" class="play_action" data-action="hud:undo">KEEP EDITING</button></div></body></rml>
